to-be-incorporated-into-paper-153 : List Word
to-be-incorporated-into-paper-153 = unlines (cons "In hyperactivity's language as the repository implements it: A reading reports its steps, and with them the memo hits (values found instead of computed) and" (cons "the values shared. The steps are the work this reading did, given what earlier readings left held" (cons "and the order the rewrites ran in: a term's second reading can cost less than its first, and with" (cons "workers a reading can find a value shared that it would have computed alone. Without the memo" (cons "(`CUBICAL_NOMEMO=1`) the count is a property of the term, the same at any number of workers;" (cons "with the memo the answers are." nil))))))
